  "id": "nsw_planning_doc_028",
  "text": "Planning Document: Marrickville DCP 2011 - 9 11 Hoskins Park Precinct 11\n\nClause 9.11.1 - heritage (heritage_protection): This precinct also contains the Hoskins Park & Environs Heritage Conservation Area.\n\nClause 9.11.1 - environmental_protection (environmental_protection): It is essential that development within the precinct considers the potential impacts to biodiversity including native fauna (including Threatened Species and Endangered Populations); native vegetation (including Endangered Ecological Communities); and habitat elements (including their condition, structure, function, connectivity and disturbance).\n\nClause 9.11.2 - heritage (heritage_protection): To protect and preserve the identified period buildings within the precinct and encourage their sympathetic alteration or restoration.\n\nClause 9.11.2 - heritage (heritage_protection): To protect the identified Heritage Items within the precinct.\n\nClause 9.11.2 - heritage (heritage_protection): To protect significant streetscapes and/or public domain elements within the precinct including landscaping, fencing, open space, sandstone kerbing and guttering, views and vistas and prevailing subdivision patterns.\n\nClause 9.11.2 - environmental_protection (environmental_protection): To ensure that any development considers all potential impacts to biodiversity.\n\nClause 9.11.2 - parking (development_control): To ensure the provision and location of off-street car parking does not adversely impact the amenity of the precinct.\n\nClause 9.11.2 - heritage (heritage_protection): To protect the identified values of the Lewisham Estate and Hoskins Park & Environs Heritage Conservation Areas.\n\n",
  "metadata": {
    "document_name": "Marrickville DCP 2011 - 9 11 Hoskins Park Precinct 11",
    "extractions_count": 8
